  "gaps": [
    {
      "title": "#crowdfund-projects does not keep its history",
      "body": "The board holds only six posts, the oldest from 2026-04-12. Everything older is gone: paging back with before= and jumping with around= both return nothing, and about 20 @everyone posts still link to crowdfund posts that no longer exist. Whether posts are removed as projects close or were purged once in a cleanup is not established — two of the six are months past their end date and still up."
    },
    {
      "title": "Sign-up counts survive only for live crowdfunds",
      "body": "For the 49 crowdfunds no longer on the board the 👍 commitment count is gone permanently. The six figures here are a snapshot of what is still posted, not a history."
    },
    {
      "title": "Eight Era 2 crowdfunds cannot be named",
      "body": "Their date and often their creator are solid; the name died with the post. Anyone holding those roles could name them instantly — the role name is the crowdfund name."
    },
    {
      "title": "Era 1 has no reliable count",
      "body": "#crowdfund-projects-legacy and #crowdfund-votes both return forbidden, as do individual Era 1 project channels. The 23 listed were reconstructed from public chat; six of them surfaced only because someone mentioned them in passing. The true figure is higher."
    },
    {
      "title": "Role membership is not readable",
      "body": "Discord does not expose role-member counts to a normal account. Turnout bounds paid membership from below — it does not measure it."
    }
  ]
}
